<title>USA: VISX sets 2.0 mln shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>VISX sets 2.0 mln shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>VISX Inc on Monday said its board of directors has approved a plan to repurchase up to 2.0 million of the company's common shares through open market transactions over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The compoany currently has about 15.4 million common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
